|help
|
|Mode ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|  ← →  h l switch mode
|           owed → activity → finished → inbox
|           docket opens start view
|  n        open the inbox
|           n again returns to owed
|  A        show all or unread
|           A switches between unread and the whole inbox
|  g        next grouping
|  t        next time window
|           owed: most overdue first
|           activity: newest first
|           finished: newest first
|
|List ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|  ↑ ↓  k j move the selection
|           (opens the accordion)
|  ⇞ ⇟      a page up or down
|  home end the first or last thread
|
|Thread ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|  ⏎        open in the browser
|  a        assign
|  r        request review
|  m        mark read
|
|Editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
|  type     filter
|  ↑ ↓      move
|  ␣        toggle
|  ⏎        apply
|  esc      cancel
|
|  ↓ 4 below

